; 005 is a minimal payment credential: the payment authorization hash
; (SHA-256 of the signed 003 TermsCBOR) plus the Buyer transaction signature
; over the exact unsigned state transaction that both sides rebuild locally
; from the OpeningProof, previous PaymentState, and the referenced 003.
; The pool correlation ID and the raw state transaction are never transmitted;
; pre-switch five-element v4 containers are rejected outright.
cumulative-payment-update = [4, payment-authorization-hash, buyer-signature]
payment-authorization-hash = bstr .size 32
buyer-signature = bstr
